WEBVTT

00:02.377 --> 00:03.628
Captioning Provided By:
MTV Networks
字幕提供者：
MTV网络

00:03.712 --> 00:05.004
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:05.088 --> 00:06.506
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:06.589 --> 00:08.383
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：
是的，是的，船长。

00:08.466 --> 00:11.177
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.261 --> 00:13.596
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.680 --> 00:15.390
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:15.473 --> 00:17.559
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.642 --> 00:19.018
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:19.436 --> 00:21.646
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.730 --> 00:23.064
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:23.440 --> 00:25.525
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:25.608 --> 00:26.609
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:26.693 --> 00:27.610
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:27.944 --> 00:29.529
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:29.612 --> 00:31.614
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:31.698 --> 00:33.533
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:33.616 --> 00:37.162
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

01:05.732 --> 01:07.233
Patrick: SpongeBob...
帕特里克：海绵宝宝……

01:07.317 --> 01:08.985
SpongeBob.
海绵宝宝。

01:13.156 --> 01:14.115
Ooh.
哦。

01:14.199 --> 01:15.325
SpongeBob...
海绵宝宝...

01:15.533 --> 01:17.660
You forgot to tell me
you were leaving.
你忘了告诉我
你要离开了。

01:19.829 --> 01:23.416
Well, Patrick, I...
guess this is...
好吧，帕特里克，我...
猜猜这是...

01:26.419 --> 01:27.629
I'm gonna
miss you, buddy.
我要
想念你，伙计。

01:27.712 --> 01:30.882
Me too, Patrick, me too.
我也是，帕特里克，我也是。

01:30.965 --> 01:34.177
♪ Sun fun island,
it's so fun ♪
♪ 阳光欢乐岛，
太有趣了♪

01:34.260 --> 01:38.681
♪ Sun fun island, here we come ♪
♪ 阳光欢乐岛，我们来了 ♪

01:38.765 --> 01:40.391
♪ Sun fun island... ♪
♪ 阳光乐趣岛... ♪

01:42.769 --> 01:45.271
♪ Sun fun island,
we can't wait ♪
♪ 阳光欢乐岛，
我们等不及了♪

01:46.898 --> 01:48.274
:
♪ La-la, la, la, la ♪
：
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦 ♪

01:48.358 --> 01:49.651
♪ La-la, la, la... ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦…… ♪

01:57.659 --> 01:59.744
Oh, Patrick, if I had
only known how hard
哦，帕特里克，如果我有的话
只知道有多难

01:59.828 --> 02:01.913
not saying good-bye could be.
不说再见也可以。

02:04.374 --> 02:05.458
Well, see you later, bud.
好吧，再见，伙计。

02:05.542 --> 02:06.626
Patrick, that's it.
帕特里克，就是这样。

02:06.876 --> 02:08.503
You can come with
me to summer camp.
你可以带着
我去夏令营。

02:08.586 --> 02:10.797
Then I never have
to say good-bye.
那我就从来没有
说再见。

02:10.880 --> 02:11.798
Summer camp?
夏令营？

02:11.881 --> 02:13.132
But I'm not even ready yet.
但我还没准备好。

02:13.216 --> 02:14.843
How 'bout now?
现在怎么样？

02:14.926 --> 02:17.637
This stuff is just
my carry-on, porter.
这东西只是
我的随身行李，搬运工。

02:17.720 --> 02:19.472
The rest of my things
are right over there.
我剩下的东西
就在那里。

02:23.560 --> 02:25.019
Patrick: Whee...
帕特里克：呼……

02:25.103 --> 02:27.564
Oh, and porter... Thanks.
哦，还有波特……谢谢。

02:39.951 --> 02:42.871
Campers: ♪ Sun fun island,
we can't wait ♪
露营者：♪ 阳光乐趣岛，
我们等不及了♪

02:42.954 --> 02:46.749
Boy, that looks like a boring
boat to be on, huh, guys?
男孩，这看起来很无聊
伙计们，要上船吗？

02:48.459 --> 02:49.377
Guys?
伙计们？

03:03.641 --> 03:06.144
Welcome to Inferno Island.
欢迎来到地狱岛。

03:06.227 --> 03:07.520
Yay!
耶！

03:07.812 --> 03:10.690
What in the seven seas just
assaulted my ear drums?
七大洋里有什么
侵犯了我的耳膜？

03:10.773 --> 03:13.943
Could that have been an
unrequested sound off?
那会不会是一个
未经请求的声音关闭？

03:14.027 --> 03:16.863
Well, it must have
been my imagination?
嗯，它一定有
是我的想象吗？

03:16.946 --> 03:18.865
And you can all thank
your lucky stars
你们都可以感谢
你的幸运星

03:18.948 --> 03:22.035
that I have a very
active imagination
我有一个非常
活跃的想象力

03:22.118 --> 03:25.371
because it so happens
that it is my sworn duty
因为事情就是这样发生的
这是我的宣誓职责

03:25.455 --> 03:27.081
to think of fun things to do
想想有趣的事情要做

03:27.165 --> 03:30.376
with the trash that
society has thrown away.
与垃圾
社会已经抛弃了。

03:30.460 --> 03:32.462
I always prefer to recycle.
我总是更喜欢回收。

03:34.047 --> 03:35.006
Holy fish paste.
圣鱼酱。

03:35.465 --> 03:37.550
We got ourselves a couple
of rabble rousers.
我们给自己找了一对
煽动者。

03:37.634 --> 03:39.052
What's your name, son?
儿子，你叫什么名字？

03:39.135 --> 03:40.261
SpongeBob SquarePants.
海绵宝宝。

03:40.345 --> 03:42.096
And are you a rabble rouser?
你是一个煽动者吗？

03:42.180 --> 03:43.306
Funny you should ask.
有趣的是你应该问。

03:43.389 --> 03:44.432
Once I...
有一次我...

03:44.766 --> 03:47.060
because you sure
look might tasty.
因为你确定
看起来可能很好吃。

03:47.143 --> 03:48.853
And it's too soon
after breakfast
而且还为时过早
早餐后

03:48.937 --> 03:51.064
for me to want to chew
somebody's head off.
让我想要咀嚼
有人掉头了。

03:51.147 --> 03:53.024
Actually, I am a little hungry.
其实我有点饿了。

03:53.107 --> 03:54.192
Hungry?
饥饿的？

03:54.609 --> 03:58.237
Barney, fetch these two
poor hungry souls a snack.
巴尼，把这两个人拿来
可怜饥饿的灵魂的零食。

03:58.321 --> 03:59.614
On the double!
上双！

04:03.910 --> 04:05.286
Both: Mmm...
两人：嗯……

04:05.370 --> 04:07.121
Oh, these guys are tough.
哦，这些家伙太难了。

04:07.205 --> 04:10.833
The food coma
is setting in.
食物昏迷
正在设置。

04:10.917 --> 04:13.419
Yeah, I could use a nap.
是的，我可以小睡一下。

04:13.503 --> 04:14.837
Did you say a nap?
你说午睡吗？

04:14.921 --> 04:17.924
Well, I know the perfect
place for you two
嗯，我知道完美的
你们两个的地方

04:18.007 --> 04:20.593
to go digest that meal.
去消化那顿饭。

04:22.387 --> 04:27.475
...couple days in the hole
never hurt anybody.
...在洞里呆了几天
永远不要伤害任何人。

04:27.558 --> 04:30.186
This camp is very upscale.
这个营地非常高档。

04:35.191 --> 04:37.694
I had no idea
they had a hot tub.
我不知道
他们有一个热水浴缸。

04:37.777 --> 04:39.779
Man: Three days later.
男：三天后。

04:39.862 --> 04:42.323
All right, let 'em out.
好吧，让他们出去吧。

04:42.407 --> 04:44.242
Now pay attention, worms.
现在注意了，虫子们。

04:44.325 --> 04:47.036
Watch the way they
crawl out on their bellies
观察他们的方式
趴着爬出来

04:47.120 --> 04:48.496
begging for mercy.
乞求怜悯。

04:48.579 --> 04:50.289
And see what's waiting for you
看看有什么在等着你

04:50.373 --> 04:55.128
next time you foul up the same
way these two did.
下次你犯同样的错误
这两个人就是这么做的。

04:55.920 --> 04:58.214
It was quite
an enjoyable soak...
这是相当
一次愉快的浸泡...

04:59.590 --> 05:00.842
That is until
this guy got thirsty
也就是直到
这家伙渴了

05:00.925 --> 05:01.968
and decided to drink
the bath water.
并决定喝酒
洗澡水。

05:02.051 --> 05:03.136
Not bad.
不错。

05:03.219 --> 05:06.055
Except for this
aftertaste.
除了这个
回味。

05:11.561 --> 05:13.646
Shut your traps,
all of you.
关闭你的陷阱，
你们所有人。

05:13.730 --> 05:15.648
Because of that little outburst
因为那小小的爆发

05:15.732 --> 05:17.650
I am going to treat you all
我会好好对待你们所有人

05:17.734 --> 05:20.778
to an activity so
heart-wrenchingly boring
到一个活动所以
无聊得令人心碎

05:20.862 --> 05:22.322
and physically exhausting
和体力消耗

05:22.405 --> 05:25.742
that it is guaranteed
to render your souls
这是有保证的
来渲染你的灵魂

05:25.825 --> 05:27.702
broken beyond repair.
破损无法修复。

05:27.785 --> 05:28.995
Yay.
耶。

05:34.334 --> 05:36.502
This is a pretty fun
camp game, huh, Patrick?
这是一个非常有趣的
营地游戏，嗯，帕特里克？

05:36.586 --> 05:37.462
Yeah.
是的。

05:37.545 --> 05:38.421
It's made even more
还做了更多

05:38.963 --> 05:40.173
fun and challenging
by the fact that we're
有趣且具有挑战性
事实上我们是

05:40.256 --> 05:41.507
wearing these
heavy ankle weights.
穿着这些
脚踝的重量很重。

05:43.134 --> 05:45.428
Warden: Good night, ladies.
典狱长：晚安，女士们。

05:47.221 --> 05:48.848
Man: My corns
won't stop ringing.
男：我的鸡眼
不会停止响铃。

05:48.931 --> 05:51.392
Man 2: I miss my
rubber ducky.
男2：我想念我的
橡皮鸭。

05:52.769 --> 05:54.062
What's wrong, SpongeBob?
怎么了，海绵宝宝？

05:54.437 --> 05:57.523
The other campers
just aren't having
as much fun as you and me.
其他营员
只是没有
和你我一样有趣。

05:57.607 --> 05:59.859
If only we could think of
some sort of group activity
如果我们能想到
某种团体活动

05:59.942 --> 06:01.527
that we could all do together.
我们都可以一起做。

06:01.611 --> 06:05.198
Then we'd all be having the same
amount of fun as each other.
那么我们都会有同样的经历
彼此都充满乐趣。

06:05.281 --> 06:06.324
Good night.
晚安。

06:06.407 --> 06:07.784
That's it.
就是这样。

06:07.867 --> 06:10.703
We'll show him
we can be self-starters.
我们将向他展示
我们可以成为自我启动者。

06:28.513 --> 06:30.098
Rise and shine.
崛起并闪耀。

06:30.181 --> 06:31.015
Now...
现在...

06:31.099 --> 06:33.059
Which one of you vile
你们哪一个卑鄙

06:33.142 --> 06:34.060
low-down
低下的

06:34.143 --> 06:35.978
foul, miserable wretched swine
肮脏的、可怜的、可怜的猪

06:36.062 --> 06:39.732
left this pathetic worthless,
horrid, meaningless...
让这个可怜的东西毫无价值，
可怕的、无意义的...

06:41.651 --> 06:42.568
Uh, abomination?
呃，可恶？

06:42.652 --> 06:45.154
Who said that?
谁说的？

06:46.405 --> 06:47.323
Me, sir.
我，先生。

06:47.573 --> 06:49.075
What is the meaning
of this thing?
有什么意义
这件事的？

06:49.158 --> 06:50.284
It's a play.
这是一场戏。

06:50.368 --> 06:54.080
For our amusement
and inspiration.
为了我们的娱乐
和灵感。

06:54.163 --> 06:55.748
Hmm...
唔...

06:55.832 --> 06:56.749
: Of course.
： 当然。

06:56.833 --> 06:57.750
Well, then...
嗯，那么...

06:57.834 --> 06:59.127
I'll watch your play.
我会看你的戏。

06:59.210 --> 07:02.213
And I will enjoy every
act of your pathetic
我会享受每一个
你可悲的行为

07:02.296 --> 07:05.258
meaningless,
ridiculous production.
无意义，
可笑的生产。

07:05.341 --> 07:06.175
You know why?
你知道为什么吗？

07:06.259 --> 07:08.052
Uh... Because you cherish
呃……因为你珍惜

07:08.136 --> 07:10.888
the fine art
of thespianism?
美术
戏剧主义？

07:10.972 --> 07:13.599
Because it'll be the
last act you'll ever perform
因为这将是
你将表演的最后一幕

07:13.683 --> 07:15.351
in your pathetic lives.
在你可悲的生活中。

07:15.434 --> 07:17.019
So get to it.
所以开始吧。

07:17.103 --> 07:20.231
And I'd better
be truly entertained.
而且我最好
得到真正的娱乐。

07:20.314 --> 07:21.691
Cool.
凉爽的。

07:24.694 --> 07:27.613
Kid's wasting his time.
孩子在浪费时间。

07:27.697 --> 07:29.490
All done.
全部完成。

07:31.242 --> 07:33.369
You thinkin' what
I'm thinkin'?
你在想什么
我在想？

07:33.452 --> 07:34.871
Uh...
呃...

07:34.954 --> 07:36.747
It's a boat,
you simpleton.
这是一条船，
你这个傻瓜。

07:36.831 --> 07:38.499
What do boats do?
船有什么作用？

07:38.583 --> 07:40.835
Uh... Make smoke.
呃……抽烟。

07:40.918 --> 07:42.837
No, you knucklehead.
不，你这个笨蛋。

07:42.920 --> 07:45.756
They float...
他们漂浮...

07:45.840 --> 07:48.050
Away from this island
远离这个岛

07:48.134 --> 07:50.636
with all of us onboard.
我们所有人都在船上。

07:50.720 --> 07:53.514
Now here's the plan.
现在这是计划。

07:55.433 --> 07:57.727
Hey, buddy,
you need some help?
嘿，伙计，
你需要帮助吗？

07:57.810 --> 07:58.644
Really?
真的吗？

07:58.728 --> 08:00.730
Sure.
当然。

08:00.813 --> 08:02.982
Man: Opening night.
男：开幕之夜。

08:09.488 --> 08:10.948
Aye, for jib's men.
是的，为了吉布的人。

08:11.032 --> 08:14.243
What forceth blow the merry
winds of Galilee?
是什么力量吹起欢乐
加利利的风？

08:14.327 --> 08:15.161
Get ready.
准备。

08:15.244 --> 08:17.038
Huh... Oh.
呃...哦。

08:17.121 --> 08:19.081
♪ 'Tis we ♪
♪ 这就是我们 ♪

08:19.165 --> 08:20.333
♪ Here to sing the song ♪
♪ 来唱歌吧 ♪

08:20.416 --> 08:22.835
♪ Of maritime camaraderie ♪
♪ 海上友情 ♪

08:22.919 --> 08:24.337
♪ Together ♪
♪ 一起 ♪

08:26.505 --> 08:27.423
♪ Together ♪
♪ 一起 ♪

08:27.506 --> 08:28.424
Together!
一起！

08:29.550 --> 08:31.677
♪ Together ♪
♪ 一起 ♪

08:33.054 --> 08:35.723
♪ Together ♪
♪ 一起 ♪

08:35.806 --> 08:36.849
Together!
一起！

08:36.933 --> 08:38.517
♪ Together ♪
♪ 一起 ♪

08:38.601 --> 08:40.019
♪ To-geth-er ♪
♪ 一起来 ♪

08:40.102 --> 08:41.062
♪ Like a boat ♪
♪ 像一条船 ♪

08:41.145 --> 08:42.521
♪ Upon the sea ♪
♪ 在海上 ♪

08:42.605 --> 08:43.564
Together.
一起。

08:43.648 --> 08:45.900
♪ In happy camaraderie ♪
♪ 快乐的友情 ♪

08:45.983 --> 08:46.943
Together.
一起。

08:47.276 --> 08:48.694
♪ That's the way
it ought to be ♪
♪ 就是这样
应该是♪

08:48.778 --> 08:50.029
Together.
一起。

08:50.112 --> 08:51.239
♪ Just you ♪
♪ 只有你 ♪

08:51.322 --> 08:52.323
♪ And you ♪
♪ 还有你 ♪

08:52.949 --> 08:54.617
All: ♪ And me... ♪
全体：♪ 而我...♪

08:54.700 --> 08:55.576
Together.
一起。

08:55.660 --> 08:57.912
♪ Together ♪
♪ 一起 ♪

08:57.995 --> 08:58.913
Together.
一起。

09:04.710 --> 09:08.339
I've never seen anything
so beautiful in my...
我从未见过任何东西
如此美丽在我的...

09:08.422 --> 09:11.384
My...
我的...

09:11.467 --> 09:13.386
OK, let's do it.
好吧，我们开始吧。

09:14.887 --> 09:16.138
SpongeBob: Uh, hey, guys,
what are you doing?
海绵宝宝：呃，嘿，伙计们，
你在做什么？

09:16.222 --> 09:18.307
We're breakin'
out of here, that's what.
我们正在打破
离开这里，就是这样。

09:18.391 --> 09:19.725
Escaping.
逃跑。

09:19.809 --> 09:22.979
Oh, and thanks for the
convincing stage craft.
哦，谢谢你
令人信服的舞台工艺。

09:24.313 --> 09:26.774
Encore, encore, encore.
安可，安可，安可。

09:28.234 --> 09:29.986
Do... Do it again.
做……再做一次。

09:35.324 --> 09:36.200
What the...
什么...

09:38.661 --> 09:40.246
Turn the ship around.
把船调转方向。

09:45.835 --> 09:47.461
Man: I can't swim.
男：我不会游泳。

09:51.841 --> 09:52.925
I'm stumped.
我很困惑。

09:53.009 --> 09:55.428
I can't even
begin to imagine
我什至不能
开始想象

09:55.511 --> 09:59.056
a punishment appropriate for
what has happened here tonight.
适当的惩罚
今晚这里发生了什么事。

09:59.140 --> 10:02.643
Words cannot attempt to
describe the disgusting
言语无法尝试
形容令人厌恶的

10:02.727 --> 10:04.145
vile, the, the...
卑鄙的，那个，那个……

10:04.687 --> 10:08.941
the complete disregard
for the storied tradition
of musical theater.
完全无视
为了传奇的传统
的音乐剧。

10:09.025 --> 10:11.068
So starting this very moment
所以从这一刻开始

10:11.152 --> 10:13.863
every one of you "subprotozoas"
你们每一个“亚原生动物”

10:13.946 --> 10:15.031
will be sentenced to...
将被判处...

10:15.114 --> 10:17.867
Man: Ahoy... Hello.
男：啊嘿……你好。

10:18.451 --> 10:19.285
Yoo-hoo.
哟吼。

10:19.368 --> 10:21.537
What in the name of...
以什么名义...

10:27.376 --> 10:28.961
For Neptune's sake, man
看在海王星的份上，伙计

10:29.045 --> 10:30.546
speak the King's English.
说国王的英语。

10:30.629 --> 10:31.714
I'm...
我是...

10:32.006 --> 10:33.841
I'm Camp Counselor Krauss
from Sun Fun Island.
我是营地辅导员克劳斯
来自阳光岛。

10:33.924 --> 10:35.551
You're who, what?
你是谁，什么？

10:35.634 --> 10:36.969
Well, I was doing roll call
嗯，我当时正在点名

10:37.053 --> 10:39.138
and discovered one of
my Sun Funners was missing.
并发现了其中之一
我的 Sun Funner 不见了。

10:39.221 --> 10:40.973
I came to take him
back with me...
我来接他
和我一起回来...

10:41.057 --> 10:43.851
...a SpongeBob SquarePants?
...海绵宝宝？

10:44.477 --> 10:46.937
Me, me...
我，我……

10:47.021 --> 10:47.855
Enough.
足够的。

10:47.938 --> 10:49.482
So tell me counselor
那么请告诉我辅导员

10:49.565 --> 10:53.402
just what do they do on
your Sunny Funny Island?
他们只是做什么
你的阳光有趣岛吗？

10:53.486 --> 10:56.030
Well, we make macaroni art.
好吧，我们制作通心粉艺术。

10:56.113 --> 10:57.114
Egad.
埃加德。

10:57.198 --> 10:58.824
And we sing campfire songs.
我们唱篝火歌曲。

10:58.908 --> 10:59.909
Ach.
阿赫。

11:00.284 --> 11:01.660
Oh, and we help
and support each other.
哦，我们帮忙
并互相支持。

11:01.744 --> 11:03.037
Stop!
停止！

11:03.120 --> 11:04.705
These heinous activities
这些令人发指的活动

11:04.789 --> 11:07.500
sound like torture
too severe for even
听起来像酷刑
太严重了，甚至

11:07.583 --> 11:12.046
the lowest, filthiest,
undeserving...
最低级的、最肮脏的、
不值得...

11:13.547 --> 11:14.340
Wait a minute...
等一下...

11:14.423 --> 11:16.175
I have a brilliant idea.
我有一个绝妙的主意。

11:23.265 --> 11:25.976
Oh, that is
very good, Bruiser.
哦，那就是
非常好，布鲁斯。

11:30.439 --> 11:31.607
Patrick?
帕特里克？

11:31.690 --> 11:32.608
You first.
你先。

11:33.818 --> 11:35.027
I...
我...

11:35.111 --> 11:37.029
I liked the other
island better.
我喜欢另一个
岛更好。

11:37.113 --> 11:38.406
Me too.
我也是。

12:00.136 --> 12:01.679
What the...
什么...

12:06.100 --> 12:07.852
Whoa, there,
calm down.
哇，那里，
冷静下来。

12:07.935 --> 12:09.061
Tell me what happened.
告诉我发生了什么事。

12:09.395 --> 12:11.230
SpongeBob and I are being
chased by a savage beast.
海绵宝宝和我正在
被野兽追赶。

12:11.313 --> 12:13.691
And he's gonna eat us.
他会吃掉我们。

12:13.774 --> 12:15.651
Oh, no, he ain't.
哦，不，他不是。

12:21.240 --> 12:22.783
There it is!
就在那里！

12:26.996 --> 12:29.373
:
This little guy?
：
这个小家伙？

12:29.457 --> 12:32.042
Why he's just
a harmless little cricket.
为什么他只是
一只无害的小蟋蟀。

12:32.126 --> 12:33.669
He's a land creature
just like me.
他是陆地生物
就像我一样。

12:33.752 --> 12:35.546
Poor thing
must've got lost.
可怜的东西
一定是迷路了。

12:35.629 --> 12:37.381
He's not gonna
hurt you...
他不会
伤害你...

12:37.465 --> 12:39.425
See?
看？

12:39.508 --> 12:42.720
Oh, let's get you back home,
little fella.
噢，让我们送你回家吧
小家伙。

12:48.225 --> 12:49.477
There you go.
就这样吧。

12:49.768 --> 12:52.104
See, that wasn't nothing
to be afraid of, huh, guys?
看吧，这并不是什么
害怕吧，伙计们？

12:56.025 --> 12:57.234
I don't have time for this.
我没有时间做这个。

12:57.318 --> 12:58.402
I'm late for my survival
training camp.
我为了生存而迟到了
训练营。

12:58.486 --> 13:00.279
Survival training camp...
生存训练营...

13:00.362 --> 13:02.114
Patrick and I  love  camping.
帕特里克和我喜欢露营。

13:02.198 --> 13:03.157
Can we come?
我们可以来吗？

13:03.532 --> 13:05.826
This ain't no ordinary
camping trip.
这不是普通的
露营旅行。

13:05.910 --> 13:07.912
I go out into the wild
我到野外去

13:07.995 --> 13:10.164
armed only with my bare hands
只用我的双手武装

13:10.247 --> 13:11.373
my quick wits
我的机智

13:11.457 --> 13:12.416
this harpoon...
这鱼叉...

13:12.500 --> 13:14.627
and 65 pounds of dynamite.
和 65 磅炸药。

13:15.377 --> 13:16.378
Out in the wild
在野外

13:16.462 --> 13:18.672
it's eat or be eaten.
它是吃或被吃。

13:18.756 --> 13:21.050
You have to be willing
to do anything
你必须愿意
做任何事

13:21.133 --> 13:23.135
when you're alone
in the wild.
当你独自一人时
在野外。

13:23.219 --> 13:25.638
You two wouldn't
last a single day.
你们两个不会
持续一天。

13:25.721 --> 13:26.597
Hey...
嘿...

13:26.680 --> 13:27.681
We would so.
我们愿意这样。

13:28.057 --> 13:29.475
I'll have you know
that just the other day
我会让你知道
就在前几天

13:29.558 --> 13:32.228
Squidward commented on
our survival skills.
章鱼哥评论了
我们的生存技能。

13:32.311 --> 13:35.147
You two are harder to
get rid of than cockroaches.
你们两个更难
比蟑螂更能除掉。

13:35.231 --> 13:38.275
Thank you,
Squidward.
谢谢你，
章鱼哥。

13:38.359 --> 13:40.903
Why aren't these
things working?
为什么不是这些
事情有效吗？

13:40.986 --> 13:42.530
No way, guys.
没办法，伙计们。

13:42.613 --> 13:45.616
This is a serious trip for
hardcore survivalists only.
这是一次严肃的旅行
仅限铁杆生存主义者。

13:45.699 --> 13:47.743
But Sandy...
但桑迪...

13:47.826 --> 13:48.619
No.
不。

13:48.702 --> 13:49.828
Ohh...
哦...

13:59.672 --> 14:00.673
Shh...
嘘...

14:01.048 --> 14:03.676
We'll show Sandy we're
as tough as she is.
我们会向桑迪展示我们
和她一样坚强。

14:05.928 --> 14:07.888
Oh, I guess the
road smoothed out.
哦，我猜是
道路变得平坦。

14:17.314 --> 14:19.275
Ahh...
啊...

14:20.776 --> 14:23.028
That was a close
one, Patrick.
那是一个关闭
一，帕特里克。

14:23.112 --> 14:25.656
We were almost left in the
wilderness without Sandy.
我们几乎被留在了
没有桑迪的荒野。

14:25.739 --> 14:27.741
And nobody would've known
where to find us.
没有人会知道
在哪里可以找到我们。

14:27.825 --> 14:30.953
Weird... There's
a door back here, too?
奇怪……有
后面还有门吗？

14:31.036 --> 14:32.204
No, Patrick, no!
不，帕特里克，不！

14:32.288 --> 14:33.789
Whoa...
哇...

14:35.332 --> 14:36.917
Sandy, wait...
桑迪，等等……

14:37.001 --> 14:38.252
Sandy...
沙...

14:38.335 --> 14:40.838
Sandy!
沙！

14:40.921 --> 14:43.674
Well, at least we have
food, shelter and water.
好吧，至少我们有
食物、住所和水。

14:43.757 --> 14:46.135
I'll pitch the tent
while you start a campfire.
我来搭帐篷
当你生起篝火时。

14:46.218 --> 14:47.428
Then when we're all settled
然后当我们都安定下来

14:47.511 --> 14:49.054
I'll cook us up some grub.
我给我们煮点食物。

14:49.138 --> 14:51.056
OK, Patrick, we're all set.
好的，帕特里克，我们都准备好了。

14:51.140 --> 14:54.184
We got fresh water,
a rugged tent for shelter...
我们得到了淡水，
一个坚固的帐篷来避难...

14:54.268 --> 14:56.562
And a nice fire
to keep us warm.
还有一团漂亮的火
让我们保持温暖。

14:56.645 --> 14:58.314
Hey, where'd you
get the fire wood?
嘿，你在哪儿
得到木柴吗？

14:58.397 --> 15:01.650
SpongeBob:  :
You burned our food supply?
海绵宝宝：：
你烧了我们的食物供应吗？

15:01.734 --> 15:04.069
Oh, no, quick, quick,
put it out with something.
噢，不，快点，快点，
用东西把它灭掉。

15:04.153 --> 15:06.280
Ahh, ahh, ahh...
啊啊啊啊啊……

15:06.363 --> 15:08.574
Hey, Patrick, nice job.
嘿，帕特里克，干得好。

15:13.912 --> 15:14.830
Whew.
呼。

15:17.833 --> 15:18.876
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

15:18.959 --> 15:20.419
Well, we burned our food
好吧，我们烧掉了食物

15:20.502 --> 15:23.088
ruined our tent
and lost all our water.
毁了我们的帐篷
并失去了所有的水。

15:23.172 --> 15:26.008
Patrick, we are gonna need to
use our razor-sharp quick wits
帕特里克，我们需要
运用我们敏锐的机智

15:26.091 --> 15:28.093
if we're gonna make it
out of here alive.
如果我们能成功的话
活着离开这里。

15:28.177 --> 15:29.053
Got ya.
明白了。

15:29.136 --> 15:30.220
OK, here's the plan.
好的，这是计划。

15:30.304 --> 15:33.015
Oh, oh, whoa... No, no.
哦，哦，哇...不，不。

15:33.098 --> 15:35.059
You made the last decision.
你做出了最后的决定。

15:35.142 --> 15:36.226
It's my turn.
轮到我了。

15:36.644 --> 15:38.729
Sure, Patrick,
what do you think we should do?
当然，帕特里克，
你认为我们应该做什么？

15:38.812 --> 15:40.189
Um...
嗯...

15:40.272 --> 15:43.317
Maybe, uh...
也许，呃...

15:44.526 --> 15:45.527
Uh, Patrick...
呃，帕特里克...

15:45.819 --> 15:47.321
Well, for crying
out loud, SpongeBob
嗯，为了哭
大声说出来，海绵宝宝

15:47.404 --> 15:49.615
I didn't rush you
when it was your turn.
我没有催你
当轮到你的时候。

15:49.698 --> 15:52.451
Sorry, sorry,
take your time.
对不起，对不起，
慢慢来。

16:02.753 --> 16:04.254
Ohh...
哦...

16:10.219 --> 16:11.095
Oh, shoot...
哦，射击...

16:11.387 --> 16:13.472
I forgot what
I was gonna say.
我忘了什么
我正想说。

16:13.555 --> 16:15.391
No hurry, Patrick.
不着急，帕特里克。

16:21.063 --> 16:23.190
Do you wanna play
hide and go seek?
你想玩吗
隐藏然后寻找？

16:23.273 --> 16:24.274
Sure.
当然。

16:24.525 --> 16:26.819
Let's go play in
that cave over there?
我们去玩吧
那边那个山洞？

16:27.861 --> 16:29.113
I like it here.
我喜欢这里。

16:29.196 --> 16:30.572
It's roomy...
很宽敞...

16:30.656 --> 16:33.826
And best of all, we have
this cave all to ourselves.
最重要的是，我们有
这个山洞全是我们自己的。

16:35.911 --> 16:36.912
Huh?
啊？

16:36.995 --> 16:37.830
Mice.
老鼠。

16:37.913 --> 16:39.081
We'll only stay here tonight
我们今晚只会留在这里

16:39.164 --> 16:40.290
and then head home tomorrow.
然后明天回家。

16:41.417 --> 16:43.001
Home?
家？

16:43.085 --> 16:45.003
This is your new home.
这是你的新家。

16:45.087 --> 16:47.131
You'll be here forever
你会永远在这里

16:47.214 --> 16:48.173
just like me...
就像我一样...

16:59.226 --> 17:00.269
Good times.
美好时光。

17:00.519 --> 17:02.229
What do you mean,
"We'll be here forever?"
你是什么意思，
“我们会永远在这里吗？”

17:02.312 --> 17:03.772
How long have  you  been here?
你来这里多久了？

17:05.107 --> 17:07.443
40 years, I been here.
40年了，我一直在这里。

17:07.526 --> 17:10.195
There ain't no way
out of this valley.
没有办法
出了这个山谷。

17:10.279 --> 17:13.282
You're stuck here with me
for the rest of your lives.
你和我一起被困在这里
为了你的余生。

17:13.365 --> 17:15.284
We'll be here forever?
我们会永远在这里吗？

17:15.367 --> 17:16.368
We're doomed.
我们注定了。

17:16.452 --> 17:17.619
Are you kidding?
你在开玩笑吧？

17:18.037 --> 17:21.290
That old coot's been here
for years and look at him.
那个老傻瓜来过这里
多年来，看看他。

17:21.373 --> 17:23.167
He's in great shape.
他身体状况很好。

17:23.250 --> 17:25.335
Look at those muscular arms.
看看那肌肉发达的手臂。

17:25.419 --> 17:27.212
His rock-hard abs.
他那坚如磐石的腹肌。

17:27.296 --> 17:29.173
And that great complexion.
还有那出色的肤色。

17:29.256 --> 17:32.050
Why he's glowing with health.
为什么他容光焕发。

17:32.134 --> 17:33.427
You're right, Patrick.
你是对的，帕特里克。

17:33.510 --> 17:34.553
But what will we eat?
但我们要吃什么呢？

17:34.636 --> 17:35.596
Where will we sleep?
我们睡哪儿？

17:35.971 --> 17:37.139
Patrick: Well, I don't
know about you
帕特里克：嗯，我不
了解你

17:37.723 --> 17:39.475
but I've got all the comforts
of home right here.
但我已经拥有了所有的舒适
家就在这里。

17:42.394 --> 17:43.520
Patrick's right.
帕特里克是对的。

17:43.854 --> 17:45.564
If I'm stuck here
I should make the best of it.
如果我被困在这里
我应该充分利用它。

17:45.647 --> 17:47.816
I'll build myself a new home.
我要为自己建造一个新家。

17:47.900 --> 17:51.278
There, just like my pineapple
in Bikini Bottom...
在那里，就像我的菠萝一样
在比基尼底部...

17:51.361 --> 17:52.988
Only smaller.
只是更小而已。

17:53.071 --> 17:54.698
: How comfy.
: 多舒服啊。

17:54.782 --> 17:57.242
Safe and sound
in my own little home.
安全无虞
在我自己的小家里。

17:57.326 --> 17:58.577
Safe?
安全的？

17:58.660 --> 18:00.329
You're never
safe out in the wild.
你从来都不是
在野外安全。

18:00.412 --> 18:01.747
If I were you...
如果我是你...

18:01.830 --> 18:04.208
I'd keep and eye
on that big fella.
我会留意
就在那个大家伙身上。

18:04.291 --> 18:05.501
Patrick?
帕特里克？

18:06.835 --> 18:08.712
Oh, Patrick is
my best friend.
哦，帕特里克是
我最好的朋友。

18:08.796 --> 18:10.214
He wouldn't hurt me.
他不会伤害我。

18:10.297 --> 18:13.884
He's a big boy.
他是个大男孩了。

18:13.967 --> 18:17.221
Out here, till
it's eat or be eaten.
在这里，直到
它是吃或被吃。

18:23.352 --> 18:25.020
He's gotten the taste of flesh.
他尝到了肉的味道。

18:26.480 --> 18:27.481
Hey, Patrick.
嘿，帕特里克。

18:27.564 --> 18:29.358
Hey, SpongeBob.
嘿，海绵宝宝。

18:30.692 --> 18:32.110
Sounds like
you're hungry.
听起来像
你饿了。

18:32.194 --> 18:33.445
Boy, am I.
男孩，我是吗？

18:33.529 --> 18:35.531
I'm so hungry...
我好饿……

18:35.614 --> 18:37.449
I could eat anything.
我什么都可以吃。

18:37.533 --> 18:39.493
I could eat
an entire sponge...
我可以吃
一整块海绵...

18:40.536 --> 18:41.995
...cake.
...蛋糕。

18:42.079 --> 18:45.707
I was just gonna share my
golden sponge cake with him.
我只是想分享我的
金色海绵蛋糕和他在一起。

18:45.791 --> 18:48.293
It's got delicious
cream filling, too.
已经好吃了
奶油馅也可以。

18:50.212 --> 18:51.255
Mmm...
嗯...

18:51.338 --> 18:52.214
It's all true.
这都是真的。

18:52.548 --> 18:53.423
Patrick  is  going to eat me.
帕特里克要吃了我。

18:53.507 --> 18:54.591
What should I do?
我应该怎么办？

18:54.675 --> 18:56.051
You gotta protect yourself.
你必须保护自己。

18:56.134 --> 18:58.512
What you need is a fort.
你需要的是一座堡垒。

18:58.595 --> 19:01.849
This mud replica
of the Krusty Krab
这个泥巴复制品
蟹堡王的

19:01.932 --> 19:03.725
should protect me from
that fiend, Patrick.
应该保护我免受
那个恶魔，帕特里克。

19:05.477 --> 19:06.311
Ah!
啊!

19:06.395 --> 19:07.271
He's on to me.
他对我有兴趣。

19:07.354 --> 19:08.397
Must hide.
必须隐藏。

19:08.480 --> 19:09.982
I'm safe.
我很安全。

19:11.108 --> 19:12.150
Patrick can't get me in here.
帕特里克不能让我进来。

19:13.402 --> 19:14.820
I don't need to go outside.
我不需要出去。

19:14.903 --> 19:17.155
I have everything
I need right here.
我拥有一切
我需要就在这里。

19:17.239 --> 19:19.533
Spatula...
抹刀...

19:19.616 --> 19:21.660
Now I just need some buns.
现在我只需要一些面包。

19:27.040 --> 19:30.335
Oh, crunchy.
哦，脆脆的。

19:35.757 --> 19:37.759
I can't take it!
我受不了！

19:38.927 --> 19:40.137
Ahh!
啊！

19:40.220 --> 19:42.347
I need some real food.
我需要一些真正的食物。

19:42.431 --> 19:43.307
Remember, kid...
记住，孩子...

19:43.390 --> 19:45.475
It's eat or be eaten.
要么吃，要么被吃。

19:45.559 --> 19:47.185
Yes, yes...
是的，是的...

19:47.269 --> 19:49.855
I shall eat Patrick
before he eats me.
我要吃帕特里克
在他吃掉我之前。

19:58.155 --> 19:59.197
Ohh...
哦...

19:59.281 --> 20:01.783
Something smells good.
有些东西闻起来很香。

20:01.867 --> 20:03.702
What are you cooking, SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝，你在做什么菜？

20:03.785 --> 20:06.580
I'm gonna cook
you up and eat ya.
我会做饭
你起来吃吧。

20:06.663 --> 20:08.749
Ah, well, why do
you wanna eat me?
啊，好吧，为什么
你想吃我吗？

20:08.832 --> 20:10.208
I know what you're going.
我知道你要做什么。

20:10.292 --> 20:12.127
You're playing dumb.
你在装傻。

20:12.211 --> 20:13.295
But it won't work
但这行不通

20:13.629 --> 20:15.589
because I'm going to eat you
before you eat me.
因为我要吃了你
在你吃掉我之前。

20:15.672 --> 20:18.759
Well, not if
I eat you first.
好吧，不是如果
我先吃你。

20:18.842 --> 20:20.719
Oh, no, you don't
哦，不，你不

20:22.679 --> 20:23.889
Where'd he go?
他去哪儿了？

20:23.972 --> 20:25.807
Come on out, Patrick.
出来吧，帕特里克。

20:25.891 --> 20:28.560
You can't hide forever.
你不可能永远隐藏。

20:28.644 --> 20:30.729
What's this... Warm water?
这是什么……温水？

20:30.812 --> 20:32.898
You seemed kind of tense
你看起来有点紧张

20:32.981 --> 20:35.359
so I drew you a hot bath.
所以我给你洗了个热水澡。

20:35.442 --> 20:36.735
Well, thanks, Patrick.
嗯，谢谢，帕特里克。

20:36.818 --> 20:39.446
I did get a trifle
unhinged, didn't I?
我确实得到了一点
我精神错乱了，不是吗？

20:39.529 --> 20:40.405
Oops...
哎呀...

20:40.489 --> 20:42.908
I forgot the bath beads.
我忘记了浴珠。

20:44.701 --> 20:46.745
Thanks, Patrick,
you're a real pal.
谢谢，帕特里克，
你是一个真正的朋友。

20:48.830 --> 20:50.415
They almost look like carrots.
它们看起来几乎像胡萝卜。

20:50.499 --> 20:51.458
Carrots?
胡萝卜？

20:51.667 --> 20:53.502
You're making soup
out of me.
你在煮汤
从我身上。

20:53.585 --> 20:56.463
I was not.
我不是。

20:56.546 --> 20:58.715
It was supposed to be stew.
本来应该是炖菜的。

21:00.425 --> 21:01.259
Whew.
呼。

21:01.343 --> 21:03.303
I'm getting tired.
我累了。

21:03.387 --> 21:05.597
Why don't you take a nap
on this nice soft bed.
你为什么不小睡一下
在这张柔软的床上。

21:05.681 --> 21:07.182
There, that's it.
就在那里，就是这样。

21:07.265 --> 21:10.269
Here, I'll tuck you in with
this nice soft blanket.
在这里，我会为你塞上被子
这条柔软的毯子。

21:10.352 --> 21:12.938
And what's a blanket
without a little ketchup?
还有什么是毯子
没有一点番茄酱？

21:13.021 --> 21:14.272
Nee-mee-nee-mee...
妮---------------

21:14.356 --> 21:16.191
This isn't a bed.
这不是床。

21:16.274 --> 21:17.693
Wait, come back.
等一下，回来吧。

21:17.776 --> 21:20.362
SpongeBob: You're not
properly seasoned.
海绵宝宝：你不是
适当调味。

21:23.699 --> 21:25.075
Mmm...
嗯...

21:25.158 --> 21:26.576
Ahh!
啊！

21:26.660 --> 21:29.121
SpongeBob: Ahh!
海绵宝宝：啊！

21:30.122 --> 21:31.707
Patrick: Whoa, hey...
帕特里克：哇，嘿……

21:31.790 --> 21:34.042
Give me that
ketchup back.
给我那个
番茄酱回来。

21:34.126 --> 21:35.293
No.
不。

21:38.088 --> 21:39.131
Got ya.
明白了。

21:39.214 --> 21:40.132
No, got you.
不，明白了。

21:40.215 --> 21:41.133
I got you.
我接到你了。

21:43.635 --> 21:46.346
Congratulations,
you did it.
恭喜，
你做到了。

21:46.430 --> 21:47.556
Did what?
做了什么？

21:47.889 --> 21:50.058
Why earn your
survivalist medals, of course.
为什么要赚取你的
当然是生存奖章。

21:50.142 --> 21:52.352
Only a hardcore survivalist
只是一个铁杆生存主义者

21:52.436 --> 21:55.147
would break down and
nearly eat his best pal.
会崩溃并且
差点把他最好的朋友吃掉。

21:55.230 --> 21:58.483
Why do you care
if we're survivalists?
你为什么关心
如果我们是生存主义者？

21:59.901 --> 22:02.446
'Cause I'm not
just some old hermit.
因为我不是
只是一些老隐士。

22:02.529 --> 22:06.408
I'm Sandy Cheeks,
survivalist extraordinaire.
我是桑迪·奇克斯
非凡的生存主义者。

22:06.491 --> 22:07.617
Sandy?
沙？

22:08.118 --> 22:10.328
It weren't no accident that
you fell out of my truck.
这并非偶然
你从我的卡车上掉下来了。

22:10.412 --> 22:12.998
I was just testing
your survival skills.
我只是在测试
你的生存技能。

22:13.081 --> 22:14.708
You planned this?
这是你策划的吗？

22:14.791 --> 22:15.751
Yup...
是的...

22:16.001 --> 22:17.711
And I'm happy to say
you both passed.
我很高兴地说
你们都通过了。

22:17.794 --> 22:19.713
Here's your survivalist medals.
这是你的生存奖章。

22:19.796 --> 22:22.090
Hooray.
万岁。

22:22.174 --> 22:24.593
Wow, it's great that
we won our medals.
哇，太好了
我们赢得了奖牌。

22:24.676 --> 22:27.179
But I'm still hungry.
但我还是饿了。

22:27.262 --> 22:28.263
Me too.
我也是。

22:28.346 --> 22:29.181
Guys...
伙计们...

22:29.264 --> 22:30.474
What ya doing?
你在做什么？

22:30.557 --> 22:31.808
Uh, fellas?
呃，伙计们？

22:31.892 --> 22:34.644
Eat or
be eaten.
吃或
被吃掉。

22:34.728 --> 22:35.771
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

22:36.021 --> 22:37.856
Next time I'll bring
more granola.
下次我会带
更多格兰诺拉麦片。

下次我会带
更多格兰诺拉麦片。